msgid "Explore and Experiment"
msgstr "탐색과 실험"

msgid "SO-101 simulated workstation in a laboratory environment."
msgstr "Laboratory 환경의 SO-101 simulation workstation입니다."

msgid ""
"Use this time to revisit a result, try another supplied model, or investigate a failure from your"
" own setup. Choose one question and change one factor at a time."
msgstr "결과를 다시 확인하거나 다른 제공 model을 시험하고, 본인 setup의 실패를 조사하세요. 질문 하나를 정하고 한 번에 한 요인만 바꿉니다."

msgid "Choose an Experiment"
msgstr "실험 선택"

msgid ""
"**Compare environments.** Use [Sim Evaluation](11-sim-evaluation.md) to compare a policy in the "
"base and DR tasks."
msgstr "**Environment 비교:** [Sim Evaluation](11-sim-evaluation.md)으로 기본 task와 DR task에서 policy를 비교합니다."

msgid ""
"**Compare data sources.** Revisit [Co-Training in Practice](13-cotraining-practice.md) and "
"compare with your sim-only results using matched starting conditions."
msgstr ""
"**Data Source 비교:** [Co-Training in Practice](13-cotraining-practice.md)를 다시 진행하고 같은 시작 조건의 sim-"
"only 결과와 비교합니다."

msgid ""
"**Investigate a failure.** Use [Debugging Sim-to-Real Issues](12-debugging-sim-to-real.md) to "
"narrow down what to test next."
msgstr "**실패 조사:** [Debugging Sim-to-Real Issues](12-debugging-sim-to-real.md)로 다음 시험 범위를 좁힙니다."

msgid ""
"**Change the scene.** Try the exercise below: adjust domain randomization or add a prop, then "
"test an existing policy."
msgstr "**Scene 변경:** 아래 실습에서 Domain Randomization을 바꾸거나 소품을 추가한 뒤 기존 policy를 시험합니다."

msgid "Try It: Change the Scene"
msgstr "실습: Scene 변경"

msgid ""
"What might change in the robot's real workspace? Use the [Architecture Tour](09-code-tour.md) and"
" [Domain Randomization](10-domain-randomization.md) to choose one variation to explore."
msgstr ""
"실제 workspace에서 무엇이 달라질 수 있나요? [Architecture Tour](09-code-tour.md)와 [Domain Randomization](10"
"-domain-randomization.md)을 참고해 variation 하나를 선택하세요."

msgid ""
"**Choose a change:** widen a lighting or object-position range, vary a material or orientation, "
"or add a lab prop such as a beaker or sample tray. You can ask Astra to design a prop for you."
msgstr ""
"**변경 선택:** 조명·object 위치 range를 넓히거나 material·orientation을 바꾸고, beaker나 sample tray를 추가해 보세요. "
"Astra에 소품 설계를 요청할 수도 있습니다."

msgid ""
"**Make the change on a new branch.** Start with one variation so you can see its effect. Keep the"
" rack reachable and leave room for the arm to move."
msgstr "**새 branch에서 변경하세요.** 효과를 확인할 수 있도록 하나만 바꿉니다. Rack은 reachable하게 유지하고 arm이 움직일 공간을 확보하세요."

msgid ""
"**Reset the simulation a few times.** Check both camera views. Does the variation look plausible?"
" Does it hide the vial or rack?"
msgstr "**Simulation을 여러 번 reset하세요.** 두 camera view에서 variation이 자연스러운지, vial이나 rack을 가리지 않는지 확인합니다."

msgid ""
"**Evaluate the same supplied policy** using [Sim Evaluation](11-sim-evaluation.md). Compare its "
"behavior with the original scene, keeping the checkpoint, starting conditions, and rollout "
"settings the same."
msgstr ""
"[Sim Evaluation](11-sim-evaluation.md)으로 **같은 제공 policy를 평가**합니다. Checkpoint, 시작 조건, rollout 설정을 "
"유지하고 원래 scene과 비교하세요."

msgid ""
"Where does the policy still work, and where does it struggle? Changing the scene tests the "
"policy's robustness; it does not train the policy to handle the new variation."
msgstr "어떤 조건에서 잘 동작하고 어디서 어려워하나요? Scene 변경은 robustness를 시험하는 것이며 새로운 variation을 학습시키는 것은 아닙니다."

msgid "Sample prompt: create and randomize a lab prop"
msgstr "Prompt 예시: Lab Prop 생성과 Randomization"

msgid "Create a Workspace With Astra"
msgstr "Astra로 Workspace 만들기"

msgid ""
"We used **Astra** to generate this laboratory workspace around our SO-101 task. The lightbox "
"panels are removed, the external camera sits on a stand, and lab benches, equipment, and overhead"
" lighting surround the robot."
msgstr ""
"**Astra**로 SO-101 task 주변의 laboratory를 생성했습니다. Lightbox panel을 제거하고 external camera를 stand에 올렸으며,"
" bench·장비·천장 조명으로 robot 주변을 구성했습니다."

msgid ""
"SO-101 workstation in an Astra-generated laboratory, with a tripod-mounted external camera, "
"benches, glassware, a centrifuge, and overhead fluorescent lights."
msgstr ""
"Tripod external camera, bench, glassware, centrifuge, fluorescent light가 있는 Astra 생성 laboratory의 "
"SO-101 workstation입니다."

msgid "The vial-to-rack workstation in a laboratory environment generated with Astra."
msgstr "Astra로 생성한 laboratory의 vial-to-rack workstation입니다."

msgid ""
"Try describing a setting for your own task. How might its lighting and background change what the"
" policy sees?"
msgstr "본인 task의 환경을 설명해 보세요. 조명과 배경이 policy 입력을 어떻게 바꿀까요?"

msgid "Sample prompt: build a laboratory environment"
msgstr "Prompt 예시: Laboratory Environment 구성"

